				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２２回目　　　悩み相談２（はじめてのポケモンは何がいい？）。　</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-08-10T06:46:24" />
